title AISOC — Tech Stack

Frontend [icon: monitor, color: blue] {
  REACT [icon: react,    label: "React 19 + TypeScript"]
  VITE  [icon: zap,      label: "Vite + Tailwind"]
  WS    [icon: activity, label: "Socket.IO (live)"]
}

Backend (single Node process) [icon: server, color: orange] {
  API  [icon: webhook, label: "Express REST API"]
  AUTH [icon: key,     label: "JWT · bcrypt · RBAC"]
  RT   [icon: radio,   label: "Socket.IO server"]

  Agents (in-process) [icon: cpu, color: purple] {
    GRAPH  [icon: git-merge, label: "LangGraph orchestrator"]
    SWARM  [icon: network,   label: "Hub + parallel workers"]
    PIPE   [icon: layers,    label: "9-layer FP pipeline"]
  }
}

LLMs [icon: brain, color: green] {
  GEMINI [icon: sparkles, label: "Google Gemini"]
  OPENAI [icon: bot,      label: "OpenAI"]
  OLLAMA [icon: box,      label: "Ollama (local + embeddings)"]
}

Data [icon: database, color: yellow] {
  DB  [icon: database,    label: "PostgreSQL"]
  MEM [icon: file-search, label: "pgvector store + RAG"]
}

External [icon: globe, color: red] {
  SIEM   [icon: alert-triangle, label: "Wazuh / SIEM"]
  NOTIFY [icon: bell,           label: "Telegram · Slack · Email · GLPI"]
  LDAP   [icon: users,          label: "LDAP / AD"]
}

SIEM > API: alerts
REACT > API: REST
RT > WS: events
API > AUTH
API > GRAPH
AUTH > LDAP
GRAPH > PIPE
PIPE > SWARM
SWARM > GEMINI
SWARM > OPENAI
SWARM > OLLAMA
SWARM > MEM
MEM > DB
GRAPH > DB
GRAPH > NOTIFY
